From: WorkBuddy <autopilot@local>
Subject: [PATCH] fix: snapshot() 空仓分支合约改用权威源 _authoritative_contract

违反红线「账户总览合约必须 = main_overrides」。
snapshot() 持仓分支(460行)已走 _authoritative_contract(main_overrides 权威源)，
但空仓分支(477行)仍直接用 contract_specs 陈旧合约，换月后空仓品种显示旧月代码。
修复：空仓分支与持仓分支保持一致，统一走 _authoritative_contract。

应用：在 futures-orderflow 目录执行 `git apply four_dim_v3.0.0_bugfix.patch`
      或 `patch -p1 < four_dim_v3.0.0_bugfix.patch`
改完需重启 runner：launchctl kickstart -k gui/502/com.ken.futures-orderflow.live
---
 account_tracker.py | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/account_tracker.py b/account_tracker.py
index 0000000..1111111 100644
--- a/account_tracker.py
+++ b/account_tracker.py
@@ -474,9 +474,9 @@ def snapshot(prices=None):
         else:
             positions.append({
                 "symbol": sym, "name": sp.get("name", sym),
-                "contract": sp.get("contract", sym),
+                "contract": _authoritative_contract(sym, sp.get("contract", sym)),
                 "direction": "—", "lots": 0, "avg": None, "price": px,
                 "float_pnl": None, "margin_used": 0, "margin_pct": 0.0,
                 "dist_to_cap": round(equity_synced * margin_cap_pct / 100, 2) if equity_synced > 0 else 0.0,
             })
